        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>13. 孩子积食后的特效食疗处方</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f2efe6;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f5f2e9;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 26px 46px 40px 34px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  /* right-hand narrow strip showing the edge of the facing page */\n  .edge-strip {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: #ded8c8;\n    border-left: 1px solid #c9c2ae;\n  }\n  .edge-strip .placeholder {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 100%;\n    border: none;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #6b6455;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-family: \"Heiti SC\", \"SimHei\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 6px 0 4px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .rule {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #4a4a4a;\n    margin: 6px 0 26px 0;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    width: 420px;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.95;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .u {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #2b4fa2;\n  }\n  /* hand-written blue numeric annotations under the prescription line */\n  .marks {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 0;\n  }\n  .mark {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n    color: #2b4fa2;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .folio {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 22px;\n    bottom: 12px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"edge-strip\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Facing page edge: partially visible vertical text, right margin]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1>13. 孩子积食后的特效食疗处方</h1>\n  <hr class=\"rule\">\n\n  <div class=\"body-text\">\n\n    <p>出现积食的症状的时候，我建议给孩子喝点儿<span class=\"u\">焦三仙配炒鸡内金</span><br>\n    <span class=\"u\">熬的水</span>。</p>\n\n    <p>有的时候我发现孩子没有任何其他的症状，<span class=\"u\">只是舌苔变厚了，嘴</span>\n    <span class=\"u\">里有味道</span>，我也会让他喝一两次焦三仙配炒鸡内金，因为<span class=\"u\">有可能他的</span>\n    <span class=\"u\">病马上就来了</span>，要提前化解掉。</p>\n\n    <p>我觉得<span class=\"u\">焦三仙和炒鸡内金</span>，是所有家庭里面应该必备的药材。</p>\n\n    <p>具体配方：<span class=\"u\">焦三仙</span>，即<span class=\"u\">焦麦芽</span>、<span class=\"u\">焦山楂</span>、<span class=\"u\">焦神曲各 6 克</span>，<span class=\"u\">炒鸡内金</span>\n    <span class=\"u\">6 克</span>。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"marks\">\n      <span class=\"mark\" style=\"left:88px; top:-12px;\">1</span>\n      <span class=\"mark\" style=\"left:158px; top:-12px;\">2</span>\n      <span class=\"mark\" style=\"left:228px; top:-12px;\">3</span>\n      <span class=\"mark\" style=\"left:352px; top:-12px;\">4</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:26px;\">鸡内金是鸡胃里面那个黄色的膜，一定要用<span class=\"u\">炒</span>的鸡内金。你在药\n    店里买焦三仙和炒鸡内金各 6 克，包成 1 包，家里一定要放上几包，\n    放在<span class=\"u\">玻璃瓶子里面密封好</span>。但凡孩子积食了，<span class=\"u\">立刻放 1 包煮水</span>，<span class=\"u\">开锅</span>\n    <span class=\"u\">后小火再煮 20 分钟就可以了</span>，喝<span class=\"u\">一两天就可以消掉积食</span>。这是所有\n    孩子的家庭必备的。</p>\n\n    <p>有的时候，你把<span class=\"u\">炒鸡内金磨碎了</span>，给孩子<span class=\"u\">冲水喝</span>、<span class=\"u\">煮水喝</span>也行。\n    还有，家里面的<span class=\"u\">锅巴也可以消积食</span>，把锅巴<span class=\"u\">烤黑了</span>以后研成末，冲水\n    给孩子喝。但是一般我主张用焦三仙和炒鸡内金煮水喝，这四味药比\n    较平和全面，基本上就能解决孩子的积食。</p>\n\n    <p>现在孩子感冒、发烧，实际上其中相当比例是<span class=\"u\">积食引起的</span>。有经\n    验的老中医，在治疗孩子<span class=\"u\">脾胃疾病</span>的时候，只要看到<span class=\"u\">孩子肚子有点儿</span></p>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"folio\">98</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
